1
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:10,086
When the witness is not found,
experience does not go blank.

2
00:00:10,897 --> 00:00:15,613
This is easy to miss. The search for
a witness often comes with a fear:

3
00:00:15,693 --> 00:00:20,110
that without it there will be
nothing, a dim and unfelt world.

4
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:22,026
The looking shows the opposite.

5
00:00:22,106 --> 00:00:24,771
The tree is more vivid, not less.

6
00:00:24,851 --> 00:00:27,778
The rain sounds closer, not further away.

7
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:30,846
What changes is not the vividness.

8
00:00:30,926 --> 00:00:33,160
What changes is the architecture.

9
00:00:33,969 --> 00:00:38,468
Ordinary experience is arranged
in pairs. A viewer and a view.

10
00:00:38,548 --> 00:00:40,193
A hearer and a sound.

11
00:00:40,273 --> 00:00:41,932
A thinker and a thought.

12
00:00:42,012 --> 00:00:45,519
Each object is placed at a distance
from the one it appears to.

13
00:00:45,599 --> 00:00:48,671
Take away the viewer, and
the distance goes too.

14
00:00:48,751 --> 00:00:52,530
The sound of rain is no longer
a sound that reaches someone.

15
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:54,881
It is simply heard, as it is.

16
00:00:54,961 --> 00:00:57,299
Nothing stands at the window receiving it,

17
00:00:57,379 --> 00:00:59,731
because nothing was ever standing there.

18
00:00:59,811 --> 00:01:03,581
The appearances are not less
real. They are less mediated.

19
00:01:04,421 --> 00:01:09,600
Think of the colour red. A patch of
red, in ordinary light. What is the red?

20
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:13,010
It is not the wavelength of
the light; that is a number,

21
00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:14,735
measured by instruments.

22
00:01:14,815 --> 00:01:16,597
It is not the cells in the eye.

23
00:01:16,677 --> 00:01:20,157
It is not the surface, which
has no colour in the dark.

24
00:01:20,237 --> 00:01:22,580
It is not the attention that picks it out.

25
00:01:23,393 --> 00:01:26,465
And yet the red is not
apart from any of these.

26
00:01:26,545 --> 00:01:29,142
Change the light, and the red changes.

27
00:01:29,221 --> 00:01:31,438
Change the eye, and it changes.

28
00:01:31,518 --> 00:01:34,513
Change the attention, and
something else stands out.

29
00:01:35,338 --> 00:01:38,275
The same grey looks
lighter on a dark ground,

30
00:01:38,355 --> 00:01:40,272
and darker on a bright one.

31
00:01:40,352 --> 00:01:42,609
The shade is not in the grey alone.

32
00:01:42,689 --> 00:01:44,393
It appears in a relation.

33
00:01:45,206 --> 00:01:48,509
This is what dependence looks
like when it is seen directly.

34
00:01:48,589 --> 00:01:50,711
The red depends on its conditions.

35
00:01:50,791 --> 00:01:52,586
And it is vivid in itself.

36
00:01:52,666 --> 00:01:54,719
It does not need a viewer behind it.

37
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:58,999
It needs the light, the eye,
the surround and the seeing.

38
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:02,889
When they meet, it is complete,
as the appearance it is.

39
00:02:03,714 --> 00:02:08,770
The Dzogchen tradition has a word for
the clarity of an appearance: luminosity.

40
00:02:08,850 --> 00:02:11,107
The word is easily misread.

41
00:02:11,187 --> 00:02:14,436
It can sound like a bright
substance behind the display,

42
00:02:14,516 --> 00:02:17,384
shining through it like
a lamp through a window.

43
00:02:17,464 --> 00:02:21,121
Looked at closely, the clarity
is not behind anything.

44
00:02:21,201 --> 00:02:24,395
It is the knowing clarity
of the appearance itself.

45
00:02:24,475 --> 00:02:27,860
A sound is heard as sound.
Cold is felt as cold.

46
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:30,853
The knowing and the
known are not two things.

47
00:02:31,678 --> 00:02:35,430
This matters, because it
removes the need for a carrier.

48
00:02:35,510 --> 00:02:40,095
A soul, a stream of consciousness,
a store of potentials:

49
00:02:40,211 --> 00:02:43,161
each of these is itself
something that appears,

50
00:02:43,241 --> 00:02:45,797
and each would need a carrier of its own.

51
00:02:45,877 --> 00:02:48,419
Luminosity is not that kind of thing.

52
00:02:48,499 --> 00:02:50,937
It is not a ground beneath appearances.

53
00:02:51,757 --> 00:02:56,758
Two things follow. Experience can be
vivid and complete without being owned.

54
00:02:56,838 --> 00:02:59,435
And it can end without
being taken from anyone.

55
00:02:59,515 --> 00:03:01,568
Nothing is lost when it passes.

56
00:03:01,648 --> 00:03:04,371
It passes because its conditions change.

57
00:03:05,177 --> 00:03:10,246
A grey wall is as vivid as a sunset,
in the sense that matters here.

58
00:03:10,326 --> 00:03:15,101
It appears, it is clear, and it is
not found apart from its appearing.

59
00:03:15,909 --> 00:03:18,505
In the seen, there is only the seen.

60
00:03:18,585 --> 00:03:20,706
In the heard, only the heard.

61
00:03:20,786 --> 00:03:23,768
And no one stands behind
it, to receive it.

